KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp20
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ span size: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ span element: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
